# "Exile up to three target cards from graveyards": on turn 3 the Pit's trigger takes two of the three cards in graveyards, one Dark Ritual
# (black) of Bot1's and Bot2's Lightning Bolt (red), one from each graveyard; Bot1's second Dark Ritual stays where it is (not
# chosen). Its last ability then adds black on turn 5 and red on turn 7, one mana of any of the exiled cards' colors, each time with
# green refused (the refusal beside the color that is taken).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Dark Ritual
Dark Ritual
Pit of Offerings
Plains
Plains
Plains
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x15

